{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14173","headline":"逢陇西故人忆关中舍弟 · 戎昱","name":"逢陇西故人忆关中舍弟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫话边庭事，心摧不欲闻。\n数年家陇地，舍弟殁胡军。\n每念支离苦，常嗟骨肉分。\n急难何日见，遥哭陇西云。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戎昱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14173.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14173","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}